text = "System enforces a deterministic 16.6ms render budget (60.0 FPS locked) on the NVIDIA RTX 2050 Mobile. By eliminating unneeded compute shaders and SSAO, GPU power consumption drops from 45W to 22W, preventing thermal throttling (80 C -> 65 C)."
